                        ],
                        "form": "вы́вихах"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "020c699c-7fd2-391e-b0c7-9b3b91420bbd",
                        "entry_id": "0296fdcd-3112-3b63-8b17-cdb4aef2632b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "мед. нарушение конгруэнтности суставных поверхностей костей, как с нарушением целостности суставной капсулы, так и без нарушения, под действием механических сил (травма) либо деструктивных процессов в суставе (артрозы, артриты)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "505e16a0-515b-4ac6-8355-767fde73e9d1",
                                "sense_id": "020c699c-7fd2-391e-b0c7-9b3b91420bbd",
                                "text": "Костоправ вышел, осмотрев ногу графа, и, выйдя в зал, чтобы велеть подать себе таз с взбитою мыльною пеной, объявил княгине, что у больного просто небольшой вывих и что он может ходить через неделю."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "f1936789-ae9d-4a74-95e8-6ef450ccf065",
                        "source_entry_id": "0296fdcd-3112-3b63-8b17-cdb4aef2632b",
                        "source_sense_id": "020c699c-7fd2-391e-b0c7-9b3b91420bbd",
                        "target_lang_word": "dislocation",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "dislocation",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "284e9822-56b7-332a-a0c8-576e183d4691",
                                        "entry_id": "53449283-8cbe-3180-8a7e-1af98d6b339c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The act of displacing, or the state of being displaced."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3198571f-c6ef-4d21-8227-7ff0109a451d",
                                                "sense_id": "284e9822-56b7-332a-a0c8-576e183d4691",
                                                "text": "As mentioned last month in the article \"Railways and the War,\" the emergency timetables were planned in view of the possibility of serious dislocation of transport by air raids in the early days of the war, and were regarded as the minimum service which would keep the activities of the country alive."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c9ba4716-9bb5-4bad-b22f-97b7115aee0f",
                                                "sense_id": "284e9822-56b7-332a-a0c8-576e183d4691",
                                                "text": "At large stations such as Euston and Birmingham New Street, it is essential to compress the station reconstruction, re-signalling and overhead wiring into the shortest possible time, not only to minimise the period of traffic dislocation but also to ensure completion by the time the remainder of the lines is electrified."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "28458087-d0ab-4ef6-8be5-664050e77c24",
                                                "sense_id": "284e9822-56b7-332a-a0c8-576e183d4691",
                                                "text": "Let's hope someone can get an original Spanish print for U.S. distribution; the redubbed Mexican version shown at the Festival does a disservice to the fine performances by its slight (but annoying) dislocations of sound and image."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3193d2df-ff5a-3038-8d87-32304a7a0553",
                                        "entry_id": "53449283-8cbe-3180-8a7e-1af98d6b339c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The displacement of parts of rocks or portions of strata from the situation which they originally occupied."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e9db09db-8173-330d-9b95-be1bdd74c2c6",
                                        "entry_id": "53449283-8cbe-3180-8a7e-1af98d6b339c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The act of dislocating, or putting out of joint; also, the condition of being thus displaced."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9a4c059a-ef71-416c-a361-a2b2ad10fd28",
                                                "sense_id": "e9db09db-8173-330d-9b95-be1bdd74c2c6",
                                                "text": "They used steroids to build strength but, more importantly, to recover from strains, pulls, dislocations."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4e128a2f-a902-3fcf-a22b-103f0c3cf23f",
                                        "entry_id": "53449283-8cbe-3180-8a7e-1af98d6b339c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A linear defect in a crystal lattice. Because dislocations can shift within the crystal lattice, they tend to weaken the material, compared to a perfect crystal."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a4ee5813-43d3-3583-b849-c7ee7112fa73",
                                        "entry_id": "53449283-8cbe-3180-8a7e-1af98d6b339c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A sentence structure in which a constituent that could otherwise be either an argument or an adjunct of a clause occurs outside of and adjacent to the clause boundaries."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bb2f3b4b-ee86-3caa-b39a-d24264c37779",
                                        "entry_id": "53449283-8cbe-3180-8a7e-1af98d6b339c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In men's gymnastics, a rotating of the shoulders when performing a backwards turn on the still rings. Many skills in acrobatics appear to involve dislocating a joint, when they actually do not."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d14c7c5e-96b0-4e0d-bb1a-7af3e9faf8a3",
                                                "sense_id": "bb2f3b4b-ee86-3caa-b39a-d24264c37779",
                                                "text": "The practice of contortion can be divided into three categories: backbending, frontbending and dislocation."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "848e9d97-b4a2-4c0b-9265-5b84d4ce846c",
                        "source_entry_id": "0296fdcd-3112-3b63-8b17-cdb4aef2632b",
                        "source_sense_id": "020c699c-7fd2-391e-b0c7-9b3b91420bbd",
                        "target_lang_word": "luxation",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "luxation",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "323eb04f-5e94-3416-bffd-e3f005664890",
                                        "entry_id": "dcb5bb78-e885-39e4-b258-ab345325b369",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Déboîtement des os, sortie de la tête d’un os de la cavité où elle doit être."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "682aff8b-4154-4f5f-b697-48926adf7ec2",
                                                "sense_id": "323eb04f-5e94-3416-bffd-e3f005664890",
                                                "text": "La luxation de l’épaule."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8cd11348-6bbc-4041-9253-ef3fcf248447",
                                                "sense_id": "323eb04f-5e94-3416-bffd-e3f005664890",
                                                "text": "Réduire une luxation."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a0ee617e-44b8-42ee-ad07-832d385738b7",
                                                "sense_id": "323eb04f-5e94-3416-bffd-e3f005664890",
                                                "text": "Le pronostic est toujours très grave, car même réduite, la luxation détermine une boiterie."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f0b50a8b-86b5-45fa-946d-1bd0cb78beb5",
                                                "sense_id": "323eb04f-5e94-3416-bffd-e3f005664890",
                                                "text": "La luxure n’est pas une luxation. C’est cependant une entorse à la chasteté."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "650f5b4f-2893-3516-8b76-3c4c53c589c1",
                                        "entry_id": "dcb5bb78-e885-39e4-b258-ab345325b369",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Déplacement."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "45879f5e-4214-4d95-b225-28e6d16010e1",
                                                "sense_id": "650f5b4f-2893-3516-8b76-3c4c53c589c1",
                                                "text": "Plus je suis convaincu qu’une seule détient la vérité, qu’hors d’elle, ce ne sont plus que des luxations d’esprit, que des impostures, que des esclandres !"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "b347f054-4420-4fb3-9891-d89643c8e6be",
                        "source_entry_id": "0296fdcd-3112-3b63-8b17-cdb4aef2632b",
                        "source_sense_id": "020c699c-7fd2-391e-b0c7-9b3b91420bbd",
                        "target_lang_word": "entorse",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "entorse",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "50292b4a-e289-3ab7-b4a9-42327b61ac44",
                                        "entry_id": "f8ff654a-4071-3028-a8d3-1e1e7be2ff31",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Distension violente et douloureuse des ligaments, et en général des parties molles qui entourent une articulation."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e96ef4f1-a760-46da-9410-1948d0226079",
                                                "sense_id": "50292b4a-e289-3ab7-b4a9-42327b61ac44",
                                                "text": "Se donner (vieilli), se faire une entorse au poignet, au genou, à la cheville, au pied."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "95ce7e26-0ded-4276-9825-d567233bfbb3",
                                                "sense_id": "50292b4a-e289-3ab7-b4a9-42327b61ac44",
                                                "text": "En mon pays, les entorses sévissent le dimanche et il n’est pas rare qu’on s’enfonce ce jour-là deux ou trois côtes en sortant du cabaret."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a57427e6-a5cf-4a92-a58d-18b4a753a675",
                                                "sense_id": "50292b4a-e289-3ab7-b4a9-42327b61ac44",
                                                "text": "Ces traitements peuvent être pris en charge par le généraliste s’il y est habitué, en particulier s’il sait évaluer la gravité de l’entorse."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6956de09-bb1b-38a5-9b0d-c261a6eecbd4",
                                        "entry_id": "f8ff654a-4071-3028-a8d3-1e1e7be2ff31",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Exception à une règle ou à une tradition."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2e7c656d-fc94-46d2-9628-c31479b73ab6",
                                                "sense_id": "6956de09-bb1b-38a5-9b0d-c261a6eecbd4",
                                                "text": "Faire une entorse au règlement."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8fbae194-82f5-463d-9e9b-1a328ec72832",
                                                "sense_id": "6956de09-bb1b-38a5-9b0d-c261a6eecbd4",
                                                "text": "Ils sont de plus en plus nombreux et nombreuses à ne reculer devant aucune entorse pour tenter d’accéder au pouvoir."
